ATrivia for Zeus --- Setup Docs



OVERVIEW --------------------

 This is a rather difficult Trivia game converted from an Excelsior!/CNet
 door.  It's pretty straightforward... The game does not keep a high score
 but rewards the user with extra time online.  This time can be adjusted
 by you in the ATrivia.zeus script at the start of the script (you'll 
 see it).



INSTALLATION ----------------

 1. Copy all files into a directory named "ATrivia" in your Doors: assign.

 2. Edit your script to do a:

 ---cut here---

 OPTION_T:
	ripreset
	callscript 'Doors:ATrivia/ATrivia'
	signal MENULOOP

 ---cut here---

 3. That's it.



